## Token discipline
- Locate via entry points, manifests, and tests. Grep before reading whole files.
- Don't crawl the whole tree. Prefer targeted file reads.
- Delegate isolated/heavy work to subagents: `repo-explorer` (read-only exploration), `feature-builder` (implements), `test-runner` (tests).

